---

Main rules are in `CLAUDE.md` and `AGENTS.md` at the repo root; read them.

- Edit only your zone: `ui/`, `data/` + `domain/`, `assets/` + `science/`, `docs/`.
- Do not change the data contract without the team lead.
- Secrets only in `android/local.properties`.
- No new dependencies without agreement.
- The demo must work offline. Every medical number needs a source.
